tify looking at the four together, without yet proving one operation.\n\nRESULT MF-083 | A1: Yes | A2: Yes | A3: No, not by itself | A4: Yes, weakly | A5: Yes | B1: Yes | B2: No | B3: Yes | B4: Yes | B5: No | B6: Yes"
